  "rows": [
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "あの……●●●●プロデューサーさん。\n元・男極主催者さんからメールが来ています。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "山村 賢"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_09_h:step-4:text",
        "step_id": 4,
        "step_index": 3,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_09_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_09_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 20,
          "target_step_index": 3
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "「我々の事務所で、近々大型ライブを開催する。\n君たちにも、是非参加してほしい！」",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_09_h:step-6:text",
        "step_id": 6,
        "step_index": 5,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_09_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_09_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 20,
          "target_step_index": 5
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "このメール、男極賞を獲った\n事務所すべてに送られていますね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "山村 賢"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_09_h:step-7:text",
        "step_id": 7,
        "step_index": 6,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_09_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_09_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 20,
          "target_step_index": 6
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ですが……返信を見る限り、\n皆さん参加されないみたいです。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "山村 賢"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_09_h:step-8:text",
        "step_id": 8,
        "step_index": 7,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_09_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_09_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 20,
          "target_step_index": 7
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "恐らくこのライブは、男極が思うようにいかなかった\n彼の気を晴らすために、用意されたものでしょう。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_09_h:step-9:text",
        "step_id": 9,
        "step_index": 8,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_09_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_09_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 20,
          "target_step_index": 8
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "彼は自分が満足できるまで、こうしたライブや、\n第二第三の男極を開き続けるのかもしれません……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_09_h:step-10:text",
        "step_id": 10,
        "step_index": 9,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_09_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_09_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 20,
          "target_step_index": 9
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "そんな相手と戦うべきではないと、\n皆さん辞退を判断されたのでしょう。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_09_h:step-11:text",
        "step_id": 11,
        "step_index": 10,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_09_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_09_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 20,
          "target_step_index": 10
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ぼくたちも、今回は参加しないほうがいいですよね。\n男極以上にあやしいライブになりそうですし……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "山村 賢"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_09_h:step-12:text",
        "step_id": 12,
        "step_index": 11,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_09_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_09_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 20,
          "target_step_index": 11
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ちょっと事務所に顔を出そうと思ったら……。\nプロデューサーちゃんたち、忙しそうですね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "山下 次郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_09_h:step-18:text",
        "step_id": 18,
        "step_index": 17,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_09_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_09_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 20,
          "target_step_index": 17
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……はざまさん、場所を変えませんか？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "山下 次郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_09_h:step-19:text",
        "step_id": 19,
        "step_index": 18,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_09_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_09_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 20,
          "target_step_index": 18
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……ああ。そうしよう。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "硲 道夫"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
